# "As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life" (CR 119.4): X can be announced no higher than the life there is to pay.
# Bot1 starts at 20 life, so X of 21 is refused while X of 1 is announced, paid and dealt (Ornithopter 0/2 survives with 1 damage).
# The refusal is judged as the cast announces X, raising it one at a time; it holds because raising stops at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fire Covenant
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Forest x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fire Covenant.Cast(X: 1)
! Bot1.Hand.Fire Covenant.Cast(X: 21)
Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 1)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Life = 19
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1
